@MarioNawfal The Islamic Republic does not need to "request" a security guarantee.

All it has to do is stop exporting terror and building up an arsenal and axis whose sole purpose is to destroy Israel and later America.

There is nothing fair about modern Iran.

@The_Tradesman1 @Shimi_Otsri More than half of Israeli Jews today are descendants of Jews who were exiled from the Middle East.

In any case, the Islamic Republic wants to kill all the Jews, regardless of ancestry.

Iran has no shared borders or interests with Israel, and no say over Jewish identity.

@MarioNawfal Netanyahu has said a lot of BS, but a nuclear Iran is not one of them.

The only reason the tyrannical Islamic Republic does not have the nuclear bomb today is that it has been thwarted, again and again and again.

You might not have a sense of self-preservation but we do.
